# Secrets and local environment
.env
venv/

# Python build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log

# Generated fleet state. Regenerated on demand; never meaningful in a diff.
runs/
telemetry/
.fleet/

# Uploaded deal documents are real counterparty material. Never commit them.
data_room/*
!data_room/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes for the hackathon submission. Useful to the author, noise to
# anyone reading the project. Listing a file here does NOT remove it from the
# repository if it is already tracked — that needs `git rm --cached <file>`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/PROMOTION.md
docs/DEVPOST.md
docs/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
BLOG_POST.md
SOCIAL_POST.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
# Kept deliberately, despite living beside the notes above:
#   docs/CLIENT.md              the client library reference, linked from the README
#   docs/INTEGRATION.md         how another system obtains credentials and calls the API
docs/architecture-diagram.* the diagram and its exports, a submission asset
examples/                   four runnable scripts; linked from the README and
#                               INTEGRATION.md, and the fastest way for a reader to
#                               answer "can I actually use this?"
